I2C is shared with other I2C devices on board like RTC/touch/audio IC etc. Try to avoid: 0x10 (audio), 0x14/0x5D (touch), 0x32 (RTC), 0x36 (camera, if fitted), 0x50 (FRAM, optional), 0x6A/0x6B (gyroscope, optional)

